   2:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @file    stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c
   4:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @brief   TIM HAL module driver.
   6:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *          functionalities of the Timer Extended peripheral:
   8:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time Hall Sensor Interface Initialization
   9:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time Hall Sensor Interface Start
  10:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time Complementary signal break and dead time configuration
  11:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time Master and Slave synchronization configuration
  12:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time Output Compare/PWM Channel Configuration (for channels 5 and 6)
  13:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Time OCRef clear configuration
  14:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *           + Timer remapping capabilities configuration
  15:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
