 121:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (+) Start the Hall Sensor Interface.
 122:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (+) Stop the Hall Sensor Interface.
 123:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (+) Start the Hall Sensor Interface and enable interrupts.
 124:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (+) Stop the Hall Sensor Interface and disable interrupts.
 125:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (+) Start the Hall Sensor Interface and enable DMA transfers.
 126:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****     (+) Stop the Hall Sensor Interface and disable DMA transfers.
